{"abstract":[{"text":"Bundle view modifiers that you regularly reuse into a custom view modifier.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/technologies","doc:\/\/com.apple.SwiftUI\/documentation\/SwiftUI","doc:\/\/com.apple.SwiftUI\/documentation\/SwiftUI\/View-fundamentals"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.SwiftUI\/documentation\/SwiftUI\/Reducing-View-Modifier-Maintenance"},"kind":"article","legalNotices":{"copyright":"Copyright &copy; 2026 Apple Inc. All rights reserved.","privacyPolicy":"https:\/\/www.apple.com\/privacy\/privacy-policy","termsOfUse":"https:\/\/www.apple.com\/legal\/internet-services\/terms\/site.html"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"SwiftUI"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"Reducing view modifier maintenance"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To create consistent views, you might reuse the same view modifier or group of modifiers repeatedly across your views.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For example, you might apply the same font and foreground color to many text instances throughout your app, so they all match.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Unfortunately, this can lead to maintenance challenges, because even a small change in format, like a different font size, requires changes in many different parts of your code.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To avoid this overhead, collect a set of modifiers into a single location using an instance of the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.SwiftUI\/documentation\/SwiftUI\/ViewModifier","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" protocol.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Then, extend the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.SwiftUI\/documentation\/SwiftUI\/View","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" protocol with a method that uses your modifier, making it easy to use and understand.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Collecting the modifiers together provides a single location to update when you want to change them.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Create-a-custom-view-modifier","level":3,"text":"Create a custom view modifier","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When you create your custom modifier, name it to reflect the purpose of the collection.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For example, if you repeatedly apply the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.SwiftUI\/documentation\/SwiftUI\/Font\/caption","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" font style and a secondary color scheme to views to represent a secondary styling, collect them together as ","type":"text"},{"code":"CaptionTextFormat","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct CaptionTextFormat: ViewModifier {","    func body(content: Content) -> some View {","        content","            .font(.caption)","            .foregroundColor(.secondary)","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Apply your modifier using the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.SwiftUI\/documentation\/SwiftUI\/View\/modifier(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" method.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The following code applies the above example to a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.SwiftUI\/documentation\/SwiftUI\/Text","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" instance:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["Text(\"Some additional information...\")","    .modifier(CaptionTextFormat())"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Extend-the-view-protocol-to-provide-fluent-modifier-access","level":3,"text":"Extend the view protocol to provide fluent modifier access","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To make your custom view modifier conveniently accessible, extend the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.SwiftUI\/documentation\/SwiftUI\/View","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" protocol with a function that applies your modifier:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["extension View {","    func captionTextFormat() -> some View {","        modifier(CaptionTextFormat())","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Apply the modifier to a text view by including this extension:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["Text(\"Some additional information...\")","    .captionTextFormat()"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Modifying-a-view","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.apple.SwiftUI\/documentation\/SwiftUI\/Configuring-Views","doc:\/\/com.apple.SwiftUI\/documentation\/SwiftUI\/View\/modifier(_:)","doc:\/\/com.apple.SwiftUI\/documentation\/SwiftUI\/ViewModifier","doc:\/\/com.apple.SwiftUI\/documentation\/SwiftUI\/EmptyModifier","doc:\/\/com.apple.SwiftUI\/documentation\/SwiftUI\/ModifiedContent","doc:\/\/com.apple.SwiftUI\/documentation\/SwiftUI\/EnvironmentalModifier","doc:\/\/com.apple.SwiftUI\/documentation\/SwiftUI\/ManipulableModifier","doc:\/\/com.apple.SwiftUI\/documentation\/SwiftUI\/ManipulableResponderModifier","doc:\/\/com.apple.SwiftUI\/documentation\/SwiftUI\/ManipulableTransformBindingModifier","doc:\/\/com.apple.SwiftUI\/documentation\/SwiftUI\/ManipulationGeometryModifier","doc:\/\/com.apple.SwiftUI\/documentation\/SwiftUI\/ManipulationGestureModifier","doc:\/\/com.apple.SwiftUI\/documentation\/SwiftUI\/ManipulationUsingGestureStateModifier","doc:\/\/com.apple.SwiftUI\/documentation\/SwiftUI\/Manipulable"],"title":"Modifying a view"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftui\/reducing-view-modifi